  "title": "Der, die oder das?",
  "subtitle": "Gender patterns for hospital nouns",
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "overview",
      "type": "overview",
      "label": "Überblick",
      "title": "Lesson intro",
      "minutes": 40,
      "learn": [
        "die: -ung, -heit, -keit, -ion, -tät, -in, and most nouns in -e. die Untersuchung, die Krankheit, die Operation, die Tablette.",
        "das: -chen, -lein, -ment, -um. das Röhrchen, das Medikament, das Zentrum.",
        "der: -er for a person or a device, -ling, -ismus, days, months, male persons. der Pfleger, der Montag, der Januar.",
        "Learn the exceptions as a short list: das Auge, der Name, die Woche. In a compound, the last noun still decides."
      ],
